License and reuse boundary for this repository

This repository is a mixed research-data package. The license terms below
apply only where the authors or repository maintainers control the rights.

Author-created repository documentation, package metadata, source-boundary
records, generated data dictionaries, workbook summaries, manifests, and
modern CSV sidecars created from the staged public-domain MetCouncil source
workbooks are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The underlying MetCouncil / Metro Transit stop boardings and alightings
source workbooks and source metadata retain the public-domain status recorded
in the accompanying metadata under the Minnesota Government Data Practices Act
(Minnesota Statutes Chapter 13). This repository does not add restrictions to
those public-domain source data.

LEHD/LODES, MetCouncil transit-stop data, and other linked public-source
inputs are not relicensed by this repository. They retain their original public
source terms and attribution or citation expectations.

The article PDF in `paper/` is included only as a local audit reference copy
and retains its publisher or repository terms. It is not relicensed here.

No MIT software license is asserted because this repository does not stage
paper-specific scripts, notebooks, model source code, or other executable
software.
